-/**
- * @file SFMT-alti.h
- *
- * @brief SIMD oriented Fast Mersenne Twister(SFMT)
- * pseudorandom number generator
- *
- * @author Mutsuo Saito (Hiroshima University)
- * @author Makoto Matsumoto (Hiroshima University)
